cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use robotruth, please cite it."
title: "robotruth: Robot CI for learned robot policies"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-18
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >
  robotruth tells a robot lab whether a policy change is real. It checks that the evaluated
  policy is the deployed policy (weights, normalizer statistics, action semantics, control
  rate, cameras, embodiment), compares policies with intervals and anytime-valid sequential
  tests, records episodes with interventions and failure classes, fingerprints the cell and
  the robot unit to catch drift, judges outcomes with calibrated abstention, and monitors
  policies at runtime with conformal thresholds.
authors:
  - name: "robotruth contributors"
